function rank(q){const qt=canon(q),n=norm(q);return(data||[]).map(e=>{let s=overlap(qt,e._t)*12;for(const t of qt){if(e._t.includes(t))s+=t.length>=7?2.6:1.7;}if(n===norm(e.q))s+=30;if(e.q.toLowerCase().includes('iram')&&/iram|memory limit/.test(n))s+=9;if(e.q.includes('GTAV_patch')&&/gtav_patch|patch/.test(n))s+=7;if(e.q.includes('movies.zip')&&/movies\.zip|movies/.test(n))s+=8;if(e.c==='troubleshoot'&&/crash|freeze|stuck|black screen|loading/.test(n))s+=2;if(e.c==='gtav'&&!/gta v|grand theft auto|cheat|heist|ending|character|michael|franklin|trevor|online/.test(n))s-=8;return{e,s}}).sort((a,b)=>b.s-a.s)}
async function parsePage(href){if(pages.has(href))return pages.get(href);const task=fetch(href,{cache:'no-cache'}).then(async r=>{if(!r.ok)return[];const d=new DOMParser().parseFromString(await r.text(),'text/html'),main=d.querySelector('main');if(!main)return[];let heading=LABEL[href]||href;const out=[];main.querySelectorAll('h1,h2,h3,p,li,summary').forEach(node=>{const text=String(node.textContent||'').replace(/\s+/g,' ').trim();if(/^H[1-3]$/.test(node.tagName)){heading=text||heading;return;}if(text.length<28||text.length>900)return;out.push({text,heading,t:canon(`${heading} ${text}`)});});return out}).catch(()=>[]);pages.set(href,task);return task;}
function passageScore(p,queryTokens,qaTokens,href){let s=overlap(queryTokens,p.t)*12+overlap(qaTokens,p.t)*8;for(const t of queryTokens)if(p.t.includes(t))s+=t.length>=7?2.5:1.5;const h=norm(p.heading);if(queryTokens.some(t=>h.includes(t)))s+=4;return s*(PAGE_WEIGHT[href]||1)}
